[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 5831.27, "timestamp": "01:37:11", "text": "环形。有些人等级达到了90级。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5835.03, "timestamp": "01:37:15", "text": "现在我最初想要的就是我的呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5839.669, "timestamp": "01:37:19", "text": "等级上限，但我当时就想，啊，这游戏真棒"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5841.91, "timestamp": "01:37:21", "text": "当你达到45级时，即可获得奖励。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5843.83, "timestamp": "01:37:23", "text": "还有一些其他的东西。这就是我唯一的理由"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5846.43, "timestamp": "01:37:26", "text": "升级了，这样我就可以获得金币了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5848.629, "timestamp": "01:37:28", "text": "武器。还有什么？我会这么做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5850.629, "timestamp": "01:37:30", "text": "就像我玩原神那样。我仍然"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5853.31, "timestamp": "01:37:33", "text": "卡在49关了。AR"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5856.55, "timestamp": "01:37:36", "text": "49. 如果把经验值也算进去的话，我应该"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5861.99, "timestamp": "01:37:41", "text": "现在应该是 AR 56、57 或 58 型了。我一直"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5866.709, "timestamp": "01:37:46", "text": "将水平上限设为 45，持续 4 年或 3 年"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5868.59, "timestamp": "01:37:48", "text": "现在。哦，我的"}]